  , { area := "Context-Decorated Logic"
      title := "Least-enabling context labels and generated-native-type adequacy"
      status := .inProgress
      codeRef := "Mettapedia/GSLT/Logic/MinimalEnablingContext.lean: ContextualRules.IsLeastEnabler / CounterCanary.two_fires_but_not_act; Mettapedia/OSLF/Framework/ConcreteHennessyMilnerBridge.lean: translated_nativeTypes_equivalent_iff_bisimilar; Mettapedia/OSLF/Framework/MinimalContextNativeTypes.lean: formulaNativeTypes_equivalent_iff_bisimilar; Mettapedia/Languages/ProcessCalculi/RhoCalculus/PlatformLabels.lean: platform_congruence / platform_hasRelativePushouts / platform_act / platform_backwardImageFiniteModulo / platform_backward_adequacy / platform_backwardAct / argsLabel_ne_channel / guard_rows_avoid / guard_evaluatorAvoids / rhoPlatform_rule_shape / rhoPlatform_arity_declared / rhoPlatform_tame / rhoPlatform_rigidHeads / rhoPlatform_leftHeadsDeclared / rhoPlatform_out_openedRules / rhoPlatform_out_arities / rhoPlatform_observerSetting; Mettapedia/Languages/ProcessCalculi/RhoCalculus/AdmissibleContexts.lean: quoteFreePath_of_parallelPath / parallelPath_not_all_quoteFree / quoting_context_separates; Mettapedia/GSLT/Logic/ParallelLeastEnablerFails.lean: least_enabler_exists / redex_isLeastEnabler_beside_bystander / composed_not_isLeastEnabler / leastEnablerComposes_fails; Mettapedia/GSLT/Logic/IPOBox.lean: bisimilar_ipoSystem_iff / bisimilar_ipoSystem_comp / backwardImageFiniteModulo_of_cancel / backward_logicallyEquivalent_iff_bisimilar"
      note := "The public serializable syntax contains an exact HML embedding into generated native types, and least-enabling context formulas compose with that same OSLF frame. Candidate rho evaluation contexts are no longer mislabeled as minimal. The class-relative congruence and the backward box now exist generically, and rho has its admissible class with the necessity of the quote exclusion witnessed; the congruence for bag contexts is proved unconditionally and schema-independently by the redex-relative route: platform_congruence, with the existence hypothesis discharged by platform_hasRelativePushouts, which holds for every span of bags, and the labelled relation shown inhabited by platform_act. What is instantiated is one ground reaction rather than rho's reaction relation - joinReaction fixes channels, values and arity, and platformRules is the singleton containing it - which the congruence does not care about but the finiteness results do: platformRules_finite holds because the set is a singleton and is false for the schema, so platform_backward_adequacy is adequacy for one ground reaction and backward image finiteness for the schema is not proved. The relation to the class the item asks for is a strict containment rather than a covering, and in the direction that limits the result: quoteFreePath_of_parallelPath places every parallel position inside the quote-free class, and parallelPath_not_all_quoteFree shows the inclusion is proper, the payload position of an output being quote-free but not parallel. So the congruence is obtained for the parallel sub-class only; congruence under output-payload contexts and under input prefixes is neither obtained nor claimed. quoting_context_separates witnesses that excluding holes under quote is necessary. Rho receives no least-enabling-context instance of the absolute interface, and this is now settled rather than open: LeastEnablerComposes is false for parallel contexts, refuted in leastEnablerComposes_fails over a commutative monoid of contexts where every plug law is an unconditional equation. Narrowing the class can repair the obligation in principle, since identityOnly_composes discharges it at the class of the identity alone; what rules out rho's class is that it contains parallel remainders, which is what the counterexample uses. The failure is not scarcity of least enablers - least_enabler_exists attains the universal property at every source there - but that composing one with its context re-adds siblings the rule never needed. The backward box follows the same diagnosis: LeastEnablerBox is generic and lawful but indexed by absolute least enablers, which are the wrong base for rho twice over - they fail to exist at sources with two incomparable completions (no_least_enabler) and they fail to compose (leastEnablerComposes_fails). IPOBox supplies distinct forward and backward idem-pushout systems. bisimilar_ipoSystem_iff identifies forward bisimilarity with IPOBisimilar, for which bisimilar_ipoSystem_comp proves congruence. The backward box adequacy theorem instead characterizes ipoBackwardSystem.Bisimilar; no theorem identifies that relation with forward IPOBisimilar or transports the forward congruence to it. Backward image finiteness is then arithmetic rather than assumed: backwardImageFiniteModulo_of_cancel derives it from cancellation of the context monoid and finiteness of the rule set, and platform_backwardImageFiniteModulo discharges it for rho, giving platform_backward_adequacy with no hypothesis left open and platform_backwardAct witnessing the step family is inhabited. What the module does not carry is equations beyond the monoid's: the bag quotient supplies the parallel equations, and alpha and the quote/drop equations are not present in it." }
