      note := "For every validated certificate calculus, a fixed-goal open proof at a context is equivalent to an element of the Yoneda representable at the one-judgment context, and this equivalence commutes with actual proof substitution. An ordered list of premise positions reindexes along contextual proof substitution by replacing each position with its image proof's ordered occurrence list; identity and composition laws define a presheaf. Forgetting a proof-bearing contextual answer to its goal and ledger is a natural transformation. The generic fibre-of-natural-observation construction makes its actual proof fibres a displayed family on the category of elements of the goal-and-ledger presheaf. A generic total-presheaf construction now collects each base value with its displayed evidence and transports both under substitution. In a shared ambient universe, dependent natural sections are equivalent to natural splittings of its projection. For actual observation fibres, the total is naturally isomorphic to the original source and its projection agrees with the original observation. Applied to exact certificate fibres, this recovers the authored proof presheaf and hence the completed-route presheaf; a concrete two-rule control remains distinct in the total while sharing its projected goal and ledger. This does not assert a global section exists, package a complete presheaf CwF, or introduce authored formers. Its fixed fibre retains the actual derivation, and the fibre reindexes with identity and composition laws including the dependent ledger index; the displayed action is proved equal to direct retained-certificate reindexing and commutes exactly with the generated operational route-receipt action, and taking the fibre commutes with the goal-and-ledger presheaf action. Only inhabitation is equivalent to the OSLF closure diamond reaching exact completion, and this observation transports forward along proof substitution with its transformed ledger; individual proof